    <string name="admin_token_title">GitHub access token</string>
    <string name="admin_token_message">The console publishes catalog.json to the TalhaGoharWeb/gohar-store repo on GitHub. Create a token at GitHub → Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Tokens (classic), with the repo scope (or a fine-grained token with Contents read/write on this repo). The token stays only on this phone and can be revoked anytime from GitHub.</string>
